# mtp_sim.jgs -- jgraph.usb.mtplist, jgraph.usb.mtp, dir, download, upload, mkdir, deleteObject and
# capture on jgraph.internal.mtpsim's devices (device classes plan, stage D12, ADR 0196). JGraph-only:
# jgraph.usb.mtp is a JGraph extension with no MATLAB counterpart, so expected/mtp_sim.txt is written
# from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in helpers/mtp_sim_case.m.

